      "id": "sha256:5b997e6e8967b7fe75af2ddf578c4528728ada9a47526b36789ca4bd6be804e2",
      "title": "In Memory of My Wife, Elise Cawley, with Thanks for 36 Wonderful Years",
      "url": "https://writings.stephenwolfram.com/2026/08/in-memory-of-my-wife-elise-cawley-1961-2026-with-thanks-for-36-wonderful-years/",
      "source_feed_ids": [
